Compile to an empty crate on WebAssembly

home looks the home directory up only on Unix and Windows, and fails to
compile elsewhere. A crate that depends on it only for code it leaves out
on WebAssembly can then still build for it.

License: Apache-2.0 (home 0.5.12)

